WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.794 --> 00:00:22.768
&gt;&gt; Laura: AN ALERT SECURITY

00:00:19.765 --> 00:00:25.070
GUARD IS BEING REGARDED AS A

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:26.872
HERO AFTER A SECURITY OFFICER

00:00:25.204 --> 00:00:28.507
SAID HE HEARD THE TEEN SAY HE

00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:29.408
WAS PLANNING TO SHOOT UP THE

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:33.946
SCHOOL AND AUTHORITIES THEN

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:35.547
FOUND HANDGUNS, TWO RIFLES AND A

00:00:34.079 --> 00:00:37.650
.90 HIGH CAPACITY MAGAZINE AT

00:00:35.681 --> 00:00:40.552
THE TEEN’S HOME.

00:00:37.783 --> 00:00:43.088
JOINING US FROM L.A. IS THE

00:00:40.686 --> 00:00:45.524
ALERT SECURITY OFFICER, MARINO

00:00:43.222 --> 00:00:47.493
CHAVEZ AND WITH ME A SPECIAL

00:00:45.658 --> 00:00:49.328
MEMBER OF THE ARMY SPECIAL

00:00:47.626 --> 00:00:50.162
FORCES AND NOW PRESIDENT OF THE

00:00:49.462 --> 00:00:53.332
SECURITY STUDIES GROUP.

00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:54.000
IT’S GREAT TO SEE YOU, MARINO,

00:00:53.466 --> 00:00:56.369
TELL US WHAT HAPPENED.

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:57.503
YOU’RE BEING HAILED AS A HERO

00:00:56.502 --> 00:00:58.704
TODAY GIVEN WHAT HAPPENED LAST

00:00:57.637 --> 00:01:00.306
WEEK IN PARKLAND.

00:00:58.838 --> 00:01:02.575
HOW DID YOU HAVE THE FORESIGHT

00:01:00.439 --> 00:01:03.676
AND TELL OUR AUDIENCE WHAT

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:06.946
OCCURRED.

00:01:03.809 --> 00:01:11.651
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT’S A FRIDAY AFTERNOON

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:12.952
AT EL CAMINO HIGH SCHOOL AND THE

00:01:11.784 --> 00:01:14.654
BELL RANG AFTER LUNCH AND

00:01:13.086 --> 00:01:17.056
WATCHING STUDENTS GO BACK TO

00:01:14.787 --> 00:01:17.891
CLASS AND OVERHEAR A STUDENT

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:20.326
STATE WATCH, THERE’S GOING TO BE

00:01:18.024 --> 00:01:22.896
A SHOOTING ON THIS CAMPUS.

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:24.631
SO I GOT JUST PART OF WHAT HE

00:01:23.029 --> 00:01:27.400
HAD SAID SO THEN I WALKED UP TO

00:01:24.764 --> 00:01:30.070
HIM AND QUESTIONED HIM AGAIN AND

00:01:27.534 --> 00:01:33.073
SAID WHAT EXACTLY DID YOU SAY

00:01:30.203 --> 00:01:36.710
AND HE IS DENYING HIM AND I

00:01:33.206 --> 00:01:42.849
ESCORTED HIM TO THE OFFICE AND

00:01:36.843 --> 00:01:46.086
CALLED THE COUNSELOR AND HE

00:01:42.983 --> 00:01:47.354
FINALLY ADMITS IT AND SAID I

00:01:46.219 --> 00:01:49.189
GUARANTEE THERE’LL BE A SCHOOL

00:01:47.487 --> 00:01:49.523
SHOOTING AND SAID I’M JUST

00:01:49.322 --> 00:01:51.391
KIDDING.

00:01:49.656 --> 00:01:53.093
I SAID YOU CAN’T SAY THAT JUST

00:01:51.525 --> 00:01:54.861
LIKE YOU CAN’T SAY BOMB ON A

00:01:53.226 --> 00:01:56.730
PLANE BECAUSE YOU’LL BE ESCORTED

00:01:54.995 --> 00:01:58.298
OFF THE PLANE.

00:01:56.863 --> 00:02:01.768
&gt;&gt; Laura: RIGHT.

00:01:58.432 --> 00:02:02.970
SO THEN AUTHORITIES WENT TO HIS

00:02:01.902 --> 00:02:05.873
HOUSE AND FOUND ALL THE WEAPONS.

00:02:03.103 --> 00:02:06.673
&gt;&gt; I TALK TO THE SHERIFF’S

00:02:06.006 --> 00:02:09.309
DEPARTMENT AND THEY INVESTIGATED

00:02:06.807 --> 00:02:10.110
AND TOOK HIM INTO CUSTODY AND

00:02:09.443 --> 00:02:20.888
CHECKED THE HOME AND FOUND THE

00:02:10.244 --> 00:02:23.591
WEAPONS.

00:02:21.021 --> 00:02:24.024
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHY HAS HE NOT BEEN

00:02:23.724 --> 00:02:25.893
IDENTIFIED.

00:02:24.158 --> 00:02:28.896
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE HE’S A MINOR.

00:02:26.026 --> 00:02:31.732
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE SHOULD BE CHARGED

00:02:29.029 --> 00:02:34.535
AS AN ADULT AS A PLOT TO BLOWUP

00:02:31.866 --> 00:02:38.472
THE SCHOOL ON SOCIAL MEDIA.

00:02:34.669 --> 00:02:40.575
MARINO DID WHAT THE FBI DID NOT

00:02:38.606 --> 00:02:43.344
DO WHEN THEY HAD SEEN THE

00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:44.212
COMMENTS ON YOUTUBE AND GOT THE

00:02:43.478 --> 00:02:46.047
TIP ON THE FBI LINE.

00:02:44.345 --> 00:02:49.484
A SECURITY OFFICER AT THE SCHOOL

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:50.952
SAID WHOA, THIS IS NOT RIGHT.

00:02:49.617 --> 00:02:53.488
&gt;&gt; WHY IS WHY ARMED SECURITY AT

00:02:51.085 --> 00:02:55.490
SCHOOLS IS A GREAT IDEA.

00:02:53.621 --> 00:02:55.890
THE ARGUMENT AGAINST IT IS

00:02:55.623 --> 00:02:57.592
ABSURD.

00:02:56.024 --> 00:02:57.892
THE IDEA IT DIDN’T HELP IS

00:02:57.725 --> 00:03:00.628
CRAZY.

00:02:58.026 --> 00:03:02.430
WHETHER THE GUY IN PARKLAND

00:03:00.762 --> 00:03:04.699
FAILED IN HIS DUTY DOESN’T

00:03:02.564 --> 00:03:06.568
INVALIDATE THE CONCEPT.

00:03:04.833 --> 00:03:11.773
THERE’S A FAMOUS SAYING FROM THE

00:03:06.701 --> 00:03:13.375
WILD WEST, GOT CREATED MEN,

00:03:11.906 --> 00:03:17.679
SAMUEL COLT MADE THEM EQUAL WITH

00:03:13.508 --> 00:03:19.514
THE PEACEKEEPER AND NOW THE

00:03:17.812 --> 00:03:22.183
CRAZY ONE IS ARMED ON TOO MANY

00:03:19.648 --> 00:03:22.918
CAMPUSES AND WE NEED TO CHANGE

00:03:22.317 --> 00:03:26.655
THAT.

00:03:23.051 --> 00:03:28.590
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE EL CAMINO IS A

00:03:26.788 --> 00:03:31.860
SMALL SCHOOL COMPARED TO PARK

00:03:28.723 --> 00:03:32.227
LANE, 200 STUDENTS COMPARED TO

00:03:31.993 --> 00:03:36.131
PARKLAND.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:36.431
ARE YOU AN UNARMED OFFICER OR

00:03:36.265 --> 00:03:37.699
ARMED.

00:03:36.565 --> 00:03:40.269
&gt;&gt; UNARMED.

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:43.105
&gt;&gt; Laura: SO YOUR ARMED OR

00:03:40.402 --> 00:03:44.673
UNARMED, SORRY, I CAN’T HEAR.

00:03:43.238 --> 00:03:45.240
&gt;&gt; NOT ARMED.

00:03:44.807 --> 00:03:46.775
NO MA’AM.

00:03:45.374 --> 00:03:48.644
WE ARE NOT ARMED.

00:03:46.909 --> 00:03:50.079
&gt;&gt; Laura: WOULD YOU PREFER TO BE

00:03:48.777 --> 00:03:51.780
ARMED OR YOU’RE NOT COMFORTABLE

00:03:50.212 --> 00:03:54.183
WITH THAT?

00:03:51.914 --> 00:03:56.585
&gt;&gt; I USED TO BE AN ARMED OFFICER

00:03:54.316 --> 00:03:56.952
BEFORE I START WITH THE SCHOOL

00:03:56.719 --> 00:03:58.187
DISTRICT.

00:03:57.086 --> 00:04:00.022
ARMED WOULD BE BETTER I COULD DO

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.557
MORE BECAUSE IF THEY’RE SHOOTING

00:04:00.155 --> 00:04:02.491
IN THE CAMPUS --

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.727
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHAT ARE YOU SUPPOSED

00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:06.162
TO DO NOW WHEN SOMEONE GETS IN

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:08.130
THE BUILDING?

00:04:06.295 --> 00:04:10.266
YOU PREVENTED A SCHOOL SHOOTING.

00:04:08.264 --> 00:04:12.435
I’M GOING SAY IT.

00:04:10.399 --> 00:04:14.670
PEOPLE SAY WELL, NO, YOU

00:04:12.568 --> 00:04:16.973
PRESENTED A SCHOOL SHOOT.

00:04:14.804 --> 00:04:19.275
WHAT WOULD HAVE HAPPENED TO THAT

00:04:17.106 --> 00:04:21.010
KID WHO WE’RE NOT IDENTIFYING

00:04:19.408 --> 00:04:21.978
BECAUSE HE’S A SNOWFLAKE, WHAT

00:04:21.143 --> 00:04:23.212
ARE YOU SUPPOSED TO DO THROW

00:04:22.111 --> 00:04:24.747
THINGS AT HIM?

00:04:23.346 --> 00:04:25.481
WHAT THE HECK ARE YOU SUPPOSED

00:04:24.881 --> 00:04:27.183
TO DO?

00:04:25.615 --> 00:04:29.819
&gt;&gt; YOU DO WHAT THE FOOTBALL

00:04:27.316 --> 00:04:31.621
COACH DID IN PARKLAND AND RUN AT

00:04:29.952 --> 00:04:35.158
THE ARMED GUNMAN AND USE YOUR

00:04:31.754 --> 00:04:35.458
OWN BODY AS ARMOR TO PROTECT

00:04:35.291 --> 00:04:37.460
KIDS.

00:04:35.591 --> 00:04:39.128
&gt;&gt; Laura: MARINO, THE TEACHERS

00:04:37.593 --> 00:04:41.898
AND THE PARENTS AND FRANKLY THE

00:04:39.262 --> 00:04:44.534
STUDENTS, IF THEY’RE NOT

00:04:42.031 --> 00:04:45.668
INDOCTRINATED BY CNN OR OTHER

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:47.537
ORGANIZATIONS, SOMEONE LIKE YOU

00:04:45.802 --> 00:04:49.139
WHO KNOWS HOW TO USE A FIREARM,

00:04:47.671 --> 00:04:53.643
THE PRESIDENT SAID THAT TODAY,

00:04:49.272 --> 00:04:55.745
PEOPLE WHO KNOW HOW TO USE

00:04:53.777 --> 00:04:56.780
FIREARMS AND ADEPT SHOULD BE

00:04:55.879 --> 00:04:57.914
ARMED AT A SCHOOL.

00:04:56.913 --> 00:05:00.684
DO YOU AGREE WITH HIM?

00:04:58.048 --> 00:05:05.222
&gt;&gt; I AGREE A LOT OF WITH HIM

00:05:00.817 --> 00:05:06.957
BECAUSE  A LOT OF OFFICERS HAVE

00:05:05.355 --> 00:05:09.693
TRAINING AND SHOULD BE STANDING

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:10.994
OUT SIDE AND SHOWING THE UNIFORM

00:05:09.826 --> 00:05:13.130
SHOWING WE’RE NOT AN EASY

00:05:11.128 --> 00:05:15.098
VICTIM.

00:05:13.263 --> 00:05:16.266
WE’LL COME IN AND SHOOT BACK IF

00:05:15.232 --> 00:05:18.669
YOU COME ON CAMPUS.

